  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is a positive integral value, then the probability that <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> will have <math><mn>3</mn></math> at its units place is"
