  "solution": {
    "text": "Given that, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Where, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is a positive integral value.<br /><br />Here, only four digits may be at the unit place ie, <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br />Let E be the event of getting <math><mn>4</mn></math> at its units place.<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴ &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</mo> <mtext>P</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>E</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>n</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>E</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>n</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>S</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>"
